WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.939 --> 00:00:15.580
children introduced themselves to the boy.

2
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.160
"I'm Will," he said.

3
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.221
"I'm going to my father's workshop."

4
00:00:22.642 --> 00:00:24.902
"Workshop?" asked Mandy.

5
00:00:24.922 --> 00:00:28.163
"He's a cooper," said Will.

6
00:00:28.183 --> 00:00:30.924
"I help him build barrels.

7
00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.661
What does your father do?"

8
00:00:33.681 --> 00:00:38.726
"Well, right now he's building a den," said Vinnie.

9
00:00:38.746 --> 00:00:40.747
"A den?"

10
00:00:41.388 --> 00:00:42.789
asked Will, confused.

11
00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:45.691
"Forget it, Will.

12
00:00:46.051 --> 00:00:49.094
Vinnie's just joking," said Mandy.

13
00:00:50.415 --> 00:00:54.098
The grocer had stepped down, and the crowd was breaking up.

14
00:00:54.118 --> 00:00:59.002
"Well, the speech is over," said Vinnie.

15
00:01:01.364 --> 00:01:04.086
"Will, we need your help," said Mandy.

16
00:01:04.106 --> 00:01:07.209
"We must find John Adams."

17
00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:11.312
Will stopped smiling and stared at them.

18
00:01:11.332 --> 00:01:13.854
"Who sent you?"

19
00:01:14.475 --> 00:01:15.816
he asked suspiciously.

20
00:01:17.497 --> 00:01:19.819
Vinnie explained what happened on the docks.

21
00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:23.582
"You must see my father," said Will.

22
00:01:23.602 --> 00:01:25.944
"He knows where Mr.

23
00:01:26.064 --> 00:01:26.644
Adams is."

24
00:01:28.065 --> 00:01:31.108
Vinnie and Mandy walked to Will's father's workshop.

25
00:01:32.828 --> 00:01:35.649
It was in a large house where Will's family lived.

26
00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:40.091
Strips of wood were stacked high outside the shop.

27
00:01:41.692 --> 00:01:44.413
Inside, a man was sitting on a bench.

28
00:01:45.994 --> 00:01:49.595
He was scraping a strip of wood with a two-handled knife.

29
00:01:49.615 --> 00:01:52.396
"What's he doing?"

30
00:01:53.217 --> 00:01:53.937
asked Mandy.

31
00:01:53.957 --> 00:01:55.958
"That's my dad.

32
00:01:57.158 --> 00:02:01.020
He's shaping a strip of wood to fit a barrel," Will explained.

33
00:02:02.652 --> 00:02:07.435
"Next he'll arrange all the strips inside metal hoops that will hold them together."

34
00:02:07.455 --> 00:02:12.497
"Will! Are you ready to help your tired father?"

35
00:02:13.258 --> 00:02:14.118
laughed the man.

36
00:02:14.138 --> 00:02:18.881
"These are my new friends, Vinnie and Mandy," said Will.

37
00:02:18.901 --> 00:02:21.182
"Hello, children!"

38
00:02:21.682 --> 00:02:22.923
cried Will's father.

39
00:02:22.943 --> 00:02:26.245
"Welcome to our home and shop."

40
00:02:26.265 --> 00:02:30.767
"Father, Vinnie and Mandy have a special message for Mr.

41
00:02:30.907 --> 00:02:32.248
Adams," said Will.

42
00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:37.043
Suddenly serious, his father looked at the children.

43
00:02:37.063 --> 00:02:40.346
"Let me see it," he said.

44
00:02:41.867 --> 00:02:42.968
Vinnie shook his head.

45
00:02:42.988 --> 00:02:46.752
"I'm sorry, sir, but only Mr.

46
00:02:46.892 --> 00:02:47.933
Adams can see it."

47
00:02:49.474 --> 00:02:51.396
Mandy looked at Vinnie proudly.

48
00:02:52.857 --> 00:02:55.679
He was taking his responsibility seriously.

49
00:02:55.699 --> 00:03:00.884
"Will, take the children inside," said his father.

50
00:03:02.292 --> 00:03:04.414
"Then go to the silversmith and find Mr.

51
00:03:04.474 --> 00:03:05.875
Revere. He will help."

52
00:03:07.357 --> 00:03:11.140
Will led Vinnie and Mandy through the house to a warm kitchen.

53
00:03:12.321 --> 00:03:15.704
In a large fireplace, a black pot was bubbling.

54
00:03:18.386 --> 00:03:22.550
The children saw more pots and pans hanging above the fireplace.

55
00:03:23.931 --> 00:03:29.096
Two little girls sat on the floor playing with cloth dolls and little teacups.

56
00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:34.301
"These are my twin sisters, Margaret and Jane," said Will.

57
00:03:34.321 --> 00:03:37.442
"Who are your friends, Will?"

58
00:03:38.102 --> 00:03:39.163
asked Will's mother.

59
00:03:40.343 --> 00:03:42.744
She sat at a table peeling potatoes.

60
00:03:44.384 --> 00:03:49.085
Will introduced Mandy and Vinnie, and then Mandy spoke to the girls.

61
00:03:49.105 --> 00:03:52.166
"What are your dolls doing?"

62
00:03:52.926 --> 00:03:53.527
she asked.

63
00:03:53.547 --> 00:03:58.348
"They are having a tea party," explained Margaret.

64
00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:03.482
"But this tea is not from England," said Jane.

65
00:04:03.502 --> 00:04:08.025
"British tea is very bad," said Margaret.

66
00:04:08.045 --> 00:04:12.947
"Didn't John Hancock get arrested for smuggling tea?"

67
00:04:13.508 --> 00:04:15.188
Vinnie whispered to Mandy.

68
00:04:16.529 --> 00:04:17.850
Will interrupted them.

69
00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.891
"Stay here.

70
00:04:20.191 --> 00:04:22.072
I will be right back," he said.

71
00:04:22.092 --> 00:04:24.854
"My mother will look after you."

72
00:04:24.874 --> 00:04:28.776
"Would you like some tea?"

73
00:04:29.586 --> 00:04:32.326
asked Jane, holding up a tiny teacup.
